config BR2_PACKAGE_HBAS_TUNERD
	bool "hbas-tunerd"
	help
	  AM/FM/WB broadcast radio for hogtied-ui. Drives the Silabs Si4763
	  on I2C bus 1 using the public Si476x command set, and serves the
	  tuner state on /run/hbas/tuner.sock. The on-hardware bring-up
	  (reset line, firmware load) is still unverified; see
	  docs/findings/RADIO.md. Sources live in software/tunerd.
